<title>USA: Norwood repurchases 48,400 common shares.</title>
<headline>Norwood repurchases 48,400 common shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwood Promotional Products Inc said Tuesday that it repurchased 48,400 shares of its outstanding common stock at an average price per share of $13.13 on April 28.</p>
</text>
